"text":"host → base64 SHA-256 digests of a certificate’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SubjectPublicKeyInfo, one of which a certificate in the verified"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"chain must have, or the request fails as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tlsPin"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is sent. A host is a name, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*."},{"type":"text","text":" and one, matching any name a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"label below it; not an IP address. Pins add to certificate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verification, never replace it: pin a CA’s key, so a leaf renewal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t break the app, and keep a backup pin. They cover the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requests the SDK makes (issuers, Authorization Servers,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Verifiers, status lists), not the app’s own, such as to its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Wallet Provider: pin that client yourself."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tlsPins","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]]","kind":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"WalletConfiguration","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":"’s configuration, its options grouped by what they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"concern: issuers, issuer metadata, Verifiers, revocation, status"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lists, the network, issuance and presentation. Its JSON form is flat,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one key per option, and unchanged by the grouping."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/Network-swift.struct/allowedPrivateHosts":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"allowedPrivateHosts"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"title":"allowedPrivateHosts","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/network-swift.struct\/allowedprivatehosts","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Hosts the wallet may reach at a private address (10\/8, 172.16\/12,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"192.168\/16, fc00::\/7) outside ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"development"},{"text":": issuers, Verifiers,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"status lists and CRL distribution points inside the deployment’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own network, an enterprise’s or a test environment’s. Each is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"host name, matched exactly and without case: no wildcard, IP","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"address, port or loopback name. Nothing else is lifted: a listed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"host is still refused at a loopback or link-local address, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every request is still HTTPS with its certificate verified. List","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only hosts the deployment runs: anyone who can hand the wallet an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offer or a request can have it send a request to them.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/Network-swift.struct\/allowedPrivateHosts","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/Network-swift.struct/init(tlsPins:allowedPrivateHosts:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/network-swift.struct\/init(tlspins:allowedprivatehosts:)","title":"init(tlsPins:allowedPrivateHosts:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/Network-swift.struct\/init(tlsPins:allowedPrivateHosts:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Network options: every field has a default."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tlsPins"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":" : ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"allowedPrivateHosts"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Wallet","navigatorTitle":[{"kind